@Marcio261 Why did you remove your comment and closed this issue?

I believe you missed something @doc77 is referring to. If you enter the amount of carbs and save the value, xDrip will show the amount of insulin needed (based on the settings) below on top of the page below the xDrip+ letters. I'll post a screenshot later, if I have access to a device.

What you've requested can be integrated into the carbs/bolus input dialog. That would be much simpler and a one-click solution.

@TheDiabeticWay I'm not sure I'd be able to do that, I'm nowhere near experienced enough to implement that yet. I can ask around and see if there's enough interest to gather some people up and help me make the db integration for whatever service we're hooking up to.

I submitted my code just a bit ago so we'll have to see what the devs say in terms of actually getting this thing into the repo.
